---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Oskar Schlemmer"
  description="Oskar Schlemmer was a German painter, sculptor, designer and choreographer associated with the Bauhaus school."
  ogImage="/images/OS-DTB-as-Dancer-turkish-Photo-DO01179.jpg"
  currentPath="/"
>
  <main class="hero">
    <div class="hero__inner">

      <div class="hero__images">
        <img
          src="/images/OS-DTB-as-Dancer-turkish-Photo-DO01179.jpg"
          alt="Oskar Schlemmer as Dancer in The Triadic Ballet, Turkish Suite"
          class="hero__dancer"
          width="190"
          height="279"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
        />
        <div class="hero__image-sep"></div>
        <a href="https://mint.schlemmer.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hero__signet-link">
          <img
            src="/images/oskar-schlemmer-bauhaus-logo.png"
            alt="Oskar Schlemmer — Bauhaus Signet, 1922–1923"
            class="hero__signet"
            width="1704"
            height="1706"
            loading="eager"
          />
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="hero__text">
        <p class="hero__date">4 September 2026</p>
        <h1 class="hero__heading">
          Birthday anniversary of<br>Oskar Schlemmer<br>(1888&thinsp;&ndash;&thinsp;1943)
        </h1>
        <p class="hero__body">
          On the occasion of his birthday, join C.&nbsp;Raman Schlemmer to remember his grandfather
          Oskar Schlemmer, whose pioneering&nbsp;œuvre crossed the boundaries of painting, sculpture,
          theatre, dance and design. His vision of the human figure in space, most famously realised
          in the dance performance&nbsp;"The Triadic Ballet" (1922), the "Bauhaus Dances", the painting
          "Bauhaus Staircase" (1932), and noted in his diaries and writings, remains an enduring
          contribution to modern art.
        </p>
        <div class="hero__ctas">
          <a href="/slideshow" class="hero__btn">› View Works</a>
          <a href="https://mint.schlemmer.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hero__btn hero__btn--outline">› Mint a Bauhaus Signet</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero__caption">Oskar Schlemmer / Jaïna Schlemmer</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    background: #000;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 5rem);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero__inner {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 3rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  /* ─── Images column ─────────────────────── */
  .hero__images {
    flex: 0 0 42%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .hero__dancer {
    max-width: 100%;
    max-height: 65vh;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
  }

  .hero__image-sep {
    width: 60%;
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  }

  .hero__signet-link {
    display: block;
    opacity: 0.85;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .hero__signet-link:hover {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .hero__signet {
    width: 140px;
    display: block;
  }

  /* ─── Text column ───────────────────────── */
  .hero__text {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .hero__date {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .hero__heading {
    font-family: "Century Gothic", "Questrial", sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.55rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero__body {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    max-width: 46ch;
  }

  .hero__ctas {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero__btn {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #000;
    background: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.6rem;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .hero__btn:hover {
    opacity: 0.75;
  }

  .hero__btn--outline {
    background: transparent;
    color: #fff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
  }

  .hero__btn--outline:hover {
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .hero__caption {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ─── Mobile ────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .hero {
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .hero__inner {
      flex-direction: column-reverse;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 3rem;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .hero__images {
      flex: none;
      width: 100%;
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .hero__dancer {
      max-height: 52vw;
      max-width: 55%;
    }

    .hero__image-sep {
      display: none;
    }

    .hero__signet {
      width: 80px;
    }

    .hero__heading {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    .hero__body {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      max-width: none;
    }
  }
</style>
